Third-party data
----------------
examples/chrono_hmmwv_17_bodies.svj.json, chrono_hmmwv_4wd, chrono_suv_patrol, chrono_generic_double_wishbones (all under examples/, .svj.json)
  Conversions, by tools/chrono_convert.py, of the HMMWV, Nissan_Patrol (suv) and generic vehicle definitions (JSON files for
  vehicle, chassis, steering, suspension, wheel, brake, driveline and tyre, with the .tir file of the HMMWV) from the Project Chrono distribution
  (https://projectchrono.org, data/vehicle). Geometry, masses, inertias, spring / damper laws and tyre coefficients are
  Project Chrono's values, re-expressed in SVJ (ISO 8855 axes, SVJ conventions). The OBJ meshes of the chassis, wheels and tyres of those models (data/vehicle/*/*.obj)
  are included, converted to OpenUSD with a glTF preview (examples/meshes/*.usdc, *.glb) without changing their vertices, under the same licence; UV coordinates and
  textures are not carried.

